"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">Contacts "
"will appear as they come online.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">If you "
"expect to see a contact, but they are not appearing</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">1) Please "
"ensure that your local mDNS server (avahi-daemon) is running properly.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">2) Run "
"\"<span style=\" font-style:italic;\">avahi-browse _presence._tcp -t\"</"
"span> in konsole and ensure you see the contact there.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">3) Ensure "
"that ports 5353/UDP and 5298/TCP are open in your firewall</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/"
"REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n"
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:10pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">ពិធីការ "
"Bonjour មិន​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​បន្ថែម​ទំនាក់ទំនង​ទេ ។ </p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">ទំនាក់ទំនង នឹង​"
"បង្ហាញ​នៅពេល​ដែល​ពួកគេ​លើ​បណ្ដាញ ។</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">ប្រសិន​បើ​អ្នក​រំពឹង​"
"មើល​ទំនាក់ទំនង ប៉ុន្តែ​មិន​បង្ហាញ​នោះ</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">1) សូម​ប្រាកដ​"
"ថា ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ mDNS មូលដ្ឋាន​របស់​អ្នក (avahi-daemon) ដំណើរការ​ត្រឹមត្រូវ ។</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">2) រត់ "
"\"<span style=\" font-style:italic;\">avahi-browse _presence._tcp -t\"</"
"span> នៅ​ក្នុង​កុងសូល ហើយ​ត្រូវប្រាកដ​ថា​អ្នក​ឃើញ​ទំនាក់ទំនង​នោះ​ទីនោះ ។</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:9pt;\">3) ត្រូវ​ប្រាកដ​"
"ថា​ច្រក 5353/UDP និង 5298/TCP គឺ​បើក​នៅ​ក្នុង​ជញ្ជាំង​ភ្លើង</p></body></html>"

